[00:07.27]Ashley Alisha：
[00:07.78] So do your best and (尽你所能)
[00:09.08] Try to drown me under (试着淹没我)
[00:11.96] Can't fix your heart (无法修复你的心)
[00:13.22] Messed up bad from the start (从一开始就弄糟了)
[00:15.11] I know you're losing sleep (我知道你辗转难眠)
[00:16.91] Thinking of me while (在想着我)
[00:19.21] I'm going all in on love oh (我正在全身心投入爱情)
[00:24.13] I've never been (我从未)
[00:25.77] One to break down (是一个崩溃的人)
[00:27.61] Even if I'm not your favorite (就算我不是你的最爱)
[00:31.27] Tired of these lies (厌倦这些谎言)
[00:33.07] Circling around (在周围盘旋)
